cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these data, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Annular liquid jets: solvers and data for exact constraint absorption and finite-time loss of global admissibility"
abstract: >-
  Chebyshev collocation and independent upwind finite-difference solvers
  for the one-dimensional annular-liquid-jet model, together with the
  drivers and data supporting the revised manuscript. Version v1.1.0 adds
  global-admissibility diagnostics, independent verification of first
  interior contact, linear response, temporal and residual audits, and
  corrected de-aliased volume quadrature.
type: software
